{"id":"98c4988827e6b3ed","group":"56","path":"56/56-ex-collapsing-levy-history.md","title":"collapsing历史必须保存在边栈中","display":"ex-collapsing-levy-history — collapsing历史必须保存在边栈中","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-ex-collapsing-levy-history","aliases":["56-ex-collapsing-levy-history"],"display":"ex-collapsing-levy-history — collapsing历史必须保存在边栈中","depends_on":["[[56-df-levy-lifted-reduction]]","[[56-df-levy-rule-lifting]]","[[56-thm-label-trace]]"],"source_section":"§8.6 Examples 8.6.55,8.6.66,8.6.71; local minimal instance","source_printed_pages":"407,411–413","source_statement_status":"local-example-computed; source-phenomenon-compared-to-local-djvu-ocr","source_proof_status":"source-argument-expanded-in-Remark; not-machine-formalized"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-ex-collapsing-levy-history"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-ex-collapsing-levy-history</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ex-collapsing-levy-history — collapsing历史必须保存在边栈中"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9618eeaafca311ce\" href=\"?note=9618eeaafca311ce\" title=\"56-df-levy-lifted-reduction\">56-df-levy-lifted-reduction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b2ae6f5d85c77f9b\" href=\"?note=b2ae6f5d85c77f9b\" title=\"56-df-levy-rule-lifting\">56-df-levy-rule-lifting</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"05941a70d7b43452\" href=\"?note=05941a70d7b43452\" title=\"56-thm-label-trace\">56-thm-label-trace</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§8.6 Examples 8.6.55,8.6.66,8.6.71; local minimal instance"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"407,411–413"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"local-example-computed; source-phenomenon-compared-to-local-djvu-ocr"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"source-argument-expanded-in-Remark; not-machine-formalized"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=(\\{c\\},\\{(c,1)\\})\">\\(\\Sigma=(\\{c\\},\\{(c,1)\\})\\)</span>、不同变量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y\\in\\mathcal V\">\\(x,y\\in\\mathcal V\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R=\\{(c(x),x)\\}\">\\(R=\\{(c(x),x)\\}\\)</span>。新的边符号e及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E,R^e\">\\(\\mathcal E,R^e\\)</span>、Lévy提升见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9618eeaafca311ce\" href=\"?note=9618eeaafca311ce\" title=\"56-df-levy-lifted-reduction\">56-df-levy-lifted-reduction</a>；直接在R中标记的路径见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b2ae6f5d85c77f9b\" href=\"?note=b2ae6f5d85c77f9b\" title=\"56-df-levy-rule-lifting\">56-df-levy-rule-lifting</a>；trace对应见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"05941a70d7b43452\" href=\"?note=05941a70d7b43452\" title=\"56-thm-label-trace\">56-thm-label-trace</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\epsilon=()\">\\(\\epsilon=()\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota_1=(1)\\in W\">\\(\\iota_1=(1)\\in W\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota_{11}=(1,1)\\in W\">\\(\\iota_{11}=(1,1)\\in W\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"s\\coloneqq c(y),\\qquad u\\coloneqq(\\epsilon,c(x),x),\\qquad\\rho\\coloneqq(\\langle c(y),y\\rangle,\\langle u\\rangle).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[s\\coloneqq c(y),\\qquad u\\coloneqq(\\epsilon,c(x),x),\\qquad\\rho\\coloneqq(\\langle c(y),y\\rangle,\\langle u\\rangle).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"X_0\\coloneqq\\mathcal E(s)=e(c(e(y))),\\qquad\\lambda^e\\coloneqq(c(x),e(x)),\\qquad a_0\\coloneqq A(X_0,\\epsilon),\\quad a_1\\coloneqq A(X_0,\\iota_1),\\quad a_2\\coloneqq A(X_0,\\iota_{11}),\\quad\\ell_0\\coloneqq a_1(x).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[X_0\\coloneqq\\mathcal E(s)=e(c(e(y))),\\qquad\\lambda^e\\coloneqq(c(x),e(x)),\\qquad a_0\\coloneqq A(X_0,\\epsilon),\\quad a_1\\coloneqq A(X_0,\\iota_1),\\quad a_2\\coloneqq A(X_0,\\iota_{11}),\\quad\\ell_0\\coloneqq a_1(x).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\rho\\in\\mathcal F_R,\\qquad\\operatorname{tgt}(\\operatorname{LPath}_R(\\rho))=y.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\rho\\in\\mathcal F_R,\\qquad\\operatorname{tgt}(\\operatorname{LPath}_R(\\rho))=y.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{tgt}(\\operatorname{EPath}_R(\\rho))=e(e(e(y)))\\ne\\mathcal E(y)=e(y).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{tgt}(\\operatorname{EPath}_R(\\rho))=e(e(e(y)))\\ne\\mathcal E(y)=e(y).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LTgt}_R(\\rho)=a_0\\bigl(C(\\lambda^e,\\ell_0,\\epsilon)(a_2(y))\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{LTgt}_R(\\rho)=a_0\\bigl(C(\\lambda^e,\\ell_0,\\epsilon)(a_2(y))\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SubLabel}_{R^e}\\bigl(a_1,\\operatorname{LTgt}_R(\\rho)(\\iota_1)\\bigr),\\qquad(V(\\epsilon),E(\\epsilon))\\in\\operatorname{Tr}_R^{\\mathrm d}(\\operatorname{wit}_R(\\rho)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SubLabel}_{R^e}\\bigl(a_1,\\operatorname{LTgt}_R(\\rho)(\\iota_1)\\bigr),\\qquad(V(\\epsilon),E(\\epsilon))\\in\\operatorname{Tr}_R^{\\mathrm d}(\\operatorname{wit}_R(\\rho)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>直接Lévy标记在变量右项y上没有函数位置可保存被收缩c的历史，所以目标只剩y。先扩展则产生一个新的e顶点，带C标签并把c的原子a1保存在其中；目标边在展开后有三条e，而不是规范初始扩展y的单条e。三个e分别来自源根边、新收缩历史以及变量实例入边。</p>\n<p>这也是不能在路径中途重置规范扩展的最小见证。对于c(c(y))先后收缩两个c，继承边栈的展开终点为五条e包裹y；若中途重新取c(y)的规范扩展，终点只剩三条e并丢失第一步C历史。实际公式按一步构造直接计算，且动态trace只从原c顶点指向目标边，不指向变量顶点。</p>\n<p>例子是原书collapsing历史丢失现象的本地最小实例，未冒充原书逐字列出的例项。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-levy-lifted-reduction","status":"resolved","id":"9618eeaafca311ce","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-levy-lifted-reduction]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-levy-rule-lifting","status":"resolved","id":"b2ae6f5d85c77f9b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-levy-rule-lifting]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-thm-label-trace","status":"resolved","id":"05941a70d7b43452","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-thm-label-trace]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-levy-lifted-reduction","status":"resolved","id":"9618eeaafca311ce","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"取 $\\Sigma=(\\{c\\},\\{(c,1)\\})$、不同变量 $x,y\\in\\mathcal V$、$R=\\{(c(x),x)\\}$。新的边符号e及 $\\mathcal E,R^e$、Lévy提升见 [[56-df-levy-lifted-reduction]]；直接在R中标记的路径见 [[56-df-levy-rule-lifting]]；trace对应见 [[56-thm-label-trace]]。$\\epsi